<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.answers`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "sign the root holder's answer to a fleet join request"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.fleet.answers", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.answers"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.answers"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.fleet.answers ~ the root holder's answer: gate pin, canon list, the sealed secret

`lares fleet join answer <request-file>` runs on the root holder: it reads the request against the face's offer and signs the answer, carrying the gate pin, the canon list and the face's address secret sealed to the key the request named. `--sync-url` and `--doc-url` name where the joinee dials. It writes the answer (`--out`) or prints it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ answer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`answer` params=`request/request.json out/answer.json ~ answer the request`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ request · face · out · sync-url · doc-url

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`request` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<request-file> ~ the request file the joining place wrote`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ which of the root holder's faces the join serves; absent, the one face standing open`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the file the next vessel reads; absent, print it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sync-url` params=`takes/url ~ the sync URL the joinee dials`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`doc-url` params=`takes/url ~ the document URL the joinee reads`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the root holder's act rides the store door under the face's root`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ request-absent · request-unread · face-malformed · admit-other-pin · request-scope-household-absent · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`request-absent` params=`cure/[[face.fleet.answers request/request.json]] ~ name the request file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`request-unread` params=`~ the file reads as no JSON`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a persona index`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`admit-other-pin` params=`~ the face's household admit commits to another gate pin`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`request-scope-household-absent` params=`~ the request names no household scope`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the answer refused by name (FleetJoinRefused, a store door refusal, or StoreHeld); the line names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ answered · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`answered` params=`exit/0 ~ the answer, written or printed`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares fleet join answer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares fleet join answer]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

